BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1430 Tm (and numbered notes on the picture itself: mostly what GroupLab corrected, sometimes what would help next) Tj ET
BT /F1 71 Tf 1 0 0 -1 381 1518 Tm (time. Use it, or take it again.) Tj ET
